      "id": "graph-hop-overview-basename-disambiguation",
      "category": "graph-hop",
      "notes": "Forces resolution of the ambiguous overview.md basename pair (projects/orion-api/overview.md vs projects/atlas-web/overview.md). The legacy monolith note links to both by path-qualified wikilink; the question only supplies enough context (customer-facing storefront) to pick one. Passing requires citing the ATLAS overview specifically — citing the Orion overview instead is a wrong-note failure, not just a miss, so this is a real discriminator, not just an any-of freebie.",
